# Database dumps, backups and key material must never reach the repository.
# A rehearsal on a restored copy produces a dump beside the checkout, and a
# *.env.missing pattern is not enough to stop `git add .` from taking it.
*.dump
*.dump.gz
*.sql.gz
*.bak
backups/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/

